Dear Chulpan,

Thank you very much for your kind email and for your continued interest 
in Raspina Clothing.

I truly appreciate the time and effort you are investing in getting to 
know our company. Your professional approach gives me great confidence, 
and I hope the information I have shared so far has given you a 
comprehensive understanding of our company, our production capabilities, 
and the way we operate.

I sincerely hope this information gives you the confidence to consider 
Raspina Clothing as a reliable manufacturing partner. I have a very 
positive feeling about our potential cooperation, and I truly hope this 
will be the beginning of a successful long-term business relationship.

Please find the requested information below:

• Legal Company Name:
Raspina Clothing

• Company Registration Number:
139650140001042566

• Trademark Registration Number:
302588

For your convenience, I have attached copies of our Company Registration 
Certificate and Trademark Registration Certificate to this email.

Regarding our Export License, our company holds a valid export license. 
As part of our standard business practice, certain legal and commercial 
documents are shared during the next stage of cooperation, particularly 
when discussing a specific project or commercial agreement. I appreciate 
your understanding, and we will be pleased to provide any additional 
documentation that may be required when appropriate.

Regarding our production facilities:

Raspina Clothing operates its own design, pattern development, cutting, 
sewing, woven fabric production, and circular knitting facilities.

In addition, we cooperate with several trusted manufacturing partners 
for specific production processes. In many cases, the machinery used by 
our partner factories has been supplied by us to ensure consistency in 
quality and production standards. For example, we have provided Stoll 
and Shima Seiki flat knitting machines, which are operated by our 
manufacturing partners exclusively according to our technical 
specifications and quality requirements to produce our collections.

This close cooperation enables us to maintain consistent quality, 
production standards, and delivery performance across all manufacturing 
processes. Every stage of production is carefully supervised by our 
team, whether it is carried out within our own facilities or by our 
trusted manufacturing partners.

Once again, thank you very much for your professionalism, your openness, 
and the confidence you have shown in learning more about our company. It 
has truly been a pleasure communicating with you, and I sincerely hope 
we will have the opportunity to build a successful and long-term 
cooperation together.

I look forward to hearing from you and to arranging our video meeting 
whenever it is convenient for you.

Kind regards,

Soheil Zali
Raspina Clothing
